hadiths[61]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1808","Nawwas bin Samaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik subah Dajjaal ka zikr kya. To Aap ne us mein past aur buland kya yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke wo khajoor key jhund mein hai. Phir jab ham shaam mein Aap key paas aey to Aap ne ham mein wo pehchaana. To farmaya: Tumhey kya hai? Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum ne subah Dajjaal ka zikr kya aur us mein past aur buland kya yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke wo khajoor key jhund mein hai. To farmaya: Dajjaal key siwa mujhey tum par zyada khauf hai. Agar wo nikley jabke main tum mein hun to main tumharey siwa uska muqaabla karne wala hun. Aur agar wo nikley jabke main tum mein nahi hun to har aadmi apna muqaabla karne wala hai, aur Allah har Musalman par mera khalifa hai. Beshak wo ghunGhriyaaley baalon wala jawaan hai, uski aankh ubhri hui hai, goya main usey Abd Al-Uzza bin Qatan key sath mushabihat deta hun. Phir tum mein se jo usey paey to us par Soorah Kahf ki ibtidai aayaat padhey. Beshak wo Shaam aur Iraq key darmiyaan raastey mein niklega. To daayein fasaad karega aur baayein fasaad karega. Ae Allah key bando saabit qadam raho. Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur zameen mein uska theherna kitna hai? Aap ne farmaya: Chaalees din: Aik din saal ki tarah, aur aik din maheeney ki tarah, aur aik din jumey ki tarah, aur uskey baqi din tumharey dinon ki tarah. Ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! To wo din jo saal ki tarah hai kya us mein hamarey liye din ki namaz kaafi hogi? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, uskey liye andaza karo. To ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur zameen mein uski tezi kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Baarish ki tarah jiska peecha hawa ne kya ho. To wo qaum par aayega aur unhey dawat dega. To wo us par imaan laaengey aur usey qabool kareingey. To wo aasmaan ko hukm dega aur wo barseyga, aur zameen ko aur wo ugaayegi. To un par unkey charney waley shaam kareingey jabke unki kohaanein sab se lambi hongi, aur unkey than sab se bharey hongey, aur unki kokhein sab se kushada hongi. Phir wo qaum par aayega aur unhey dawat dega. To wo uska qaul radd kareingey. To wo un se munh pherega. To wo subah qehat mein hongey jabke unkey haathon mein unkey maalon mein se kuchh nahi hoga. Aur wo weeraney par guzrega aur us se kaheyga: Apne khazaaney nikaal. To uskey khazaaney uskey peechey chalengey jaisa narr shahad ki makhiyon key peechey chalti hain. Phir wo jawani se bharey huey aadmi ko bulayega aur usey talwaar key sath maarega aur usey do tukdey kar dega nishaaney par teer ki maar ki tarah. Phir usey bulayega aur wo aayega jabke uska chehra khil raha hoga aur hansta hoga. Isi haal mein Allah Taala Masih Ibn Maryam (Alehis salaam) ko bhejega. To wo Damishq key mashriq mein safed meenaar key paas do rangey huey kapdon mein utreingey, apni donon hatheliyan do farishton key paron par rakhtey huey. Jab apna sar jhukaengey to qatra girega, aur jab uthayengey to us se moti jaisey daaney behengay. Kisi kaafir key liye halaal nahi jo unki saans paey magar mar jaeyga, aur unki saans wahaan tak pahunchti hai jahaan tak unki nazar pahunchti hai. To wo usey talaash kareingey yahan tak ke usey Baab-e-Ludd par paengey aur qatl kareingey. Phir Eesa (Alehis salaam) us qaum key paas aaengey jinhey Allah ne us se bachaaya hai. To unkey chehron ka masah kareingey aur unhey Jannat mein unkey darjaat ki khabar deingey. Isi haal mein Allah Taala Eesa (Alehis salaam) ki taraf wahi farmayega: Beshak main ne apne aise bandey nikaaley hain jin se qitaal ki kisi ko taqat nahi. Isliye merey bandon ko Toor ki taraf panah dey. Aur Allah Yaajooj aur Maajooj ko bhejega jabke wo har bulandi se daudtey hain. To unkey awwal Tiberiya ki jheel par guzreingey aur jo us mein hai piyengey. Aur unkey aakhir guzreingey aur kaheingey: Beshak is mein aik martaba paani tha. Aur Allah key Nabi Eesa (Alehis salaam) aur unkey saathi gher liye jaengey yahan tak ke bail ka sar un mein se aik key liye tumharey aaj key sau deenaar se behtar hoga. To Allah key Nabi Eesa (Alehis salaam) aur unkey saathi (Raziallahu anhum) Allah Taala ki taraf raghbat kareingey. To Allah Taala un par gardanon mein keedey bhejega. To wo subah marey huey hongey aik jaan ki maut ki tarah. Phir Allah key Nabi Eesa (Alehis salaam) aur unkey saathi (Raziallahu anhum) zameen ki taraf utreingey. To wo zameen mein baalisht bhar jagah nahi paengey magar usey unki badbu aur naapaaki ne bhar diya hoga. To Allah key Nabi Eesa (Alehis salaam) aur unkey saathi (Raziallahu anhum) Allah Taala ki taraf raghbat kareingey. To Allah Taala Bukhti oonton ki gardnon jaisey parindey bhejega. To wo unhey uthayengey aur jahaan Allah chaaheyga phenk deingey. Phir Allah Azza wa Jall baarish bhejega jis se kachchey ya pakkey baalon ka koi ghar nahi bachega. To wo zameen ko dho degi yahan tak ke usey aainey ki tarah chhor degi. Phir zameen se kaha jaeyga: Apna phal ugaa aur apni barkat wapas kar. To us din jamaat anaar mein se khaayegi aur uskey chhilkey se saaya haasil karegi. Aur doodh mein barkat hogi yahan tak ke oontni ka doodh logon ki jamaat ko kaafi hoga, aur gaay ka doodh qabeeley ko kaafi hoga, aur bakri ka doodh khaandaan ko kaafi hoga. Isi haal mein Allah Taala pakeeza hawa bhejega. To wo unhey unki baghlon key neechey pakdegi aur har momin aur har Musalman ki rooh qabz karegi. Aur badtareen log baqi raheingey jo us mein gadhey ki tarah khullam khulla bura kaam kareingey aur unhi par qayamat qaim hogi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul khallata bainash Shaam wal Iraq yaani un donon key darmiyaan raasta. Aur uska qaul aasa ain muhmala aur sa musallasa key sath hai, wal'ais sakht fasaad hai. Wazzura zaal muqta muqta key zamma key sath hai aur wo kohaanon ki bulandiyan hain, aur wo zirwah ki jama hai zirwah zaal key zamma aur kasra key sath. Walya'aaseeb narr shahad ki makhiyon key hain. Wajazlatain yaani do tukdey. Walgharaz wo nishaana hai jis par teer se nishaana lagaya jaata hai, yaani usey teer ki maar ki tarah maarey nishaaney par. Walmahroodah daal muhmala aur muqta muqta key sath hai, aur wo ranga hua kapda hai. Uska qaul la yadaan yaani taqat nahi. Wannaghaf keedey hain. Wafarsa farees ki jama hai, aur wo maqtool hai. Wazzalqah za aur laam key fatha aur qaaf key sath hai, aur riwayat kya gaya: Azzulfah za key zamma aur laam key sukoon aur fa key sath, aur wo aaina hai. Wal'isaabah jamaat hai. Warrisl ra key kasra key sath hai: Doodh hai. Walliqhah doodh wali hai. Walfiaam fa key kasra aur uskey baad madd hamza key sath hai: Jamaat hai. Walfakhz logon mein se qabeeley se kam hai."
"1809","Ribee bin Hiraash se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Abu Masood Ansaari key sath Huzaifa bin Al-Yamaan (Raziallahu anhum) key paas gaya. To Abu Masood ne un se kaha: Mujhey wo bayan karo jo tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Dajjaal key baarey mein suna hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Dajjaal niklega aur uskey sath paani aur aag hogi. Raha jo log paani dekhtey hain to wo jalaaney wali aag hai, aur raha jo log aag dekhtey hain to wo thanda meetha paani hai. Phir tum mein se jo usey paey to us mein giR padey jisey wo aag dekhta hai, kyonke wo meetha paakiza paani hai. To Abu Masood ne kaha: Aur main ne usey suna hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1810","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein Dajjaal niklega aur chaalees theherega, mujhey nahi maloom aik din ya chaalees maheena ya chaalees saal. To Allah Taala Eesa bin Maryam (Alehis salaam) ko bhejega. To wo usey talaash kareingey aur halaak kareingey. Phir log saat saal thehereingey jabke do key darmiyaan dushmani nahi hogi. Phir Allah Azza wa Jall Shaam ki taraf se thandi hawa bhejega. To zameen key chehrey par koi nahi baqi raheyga jiskey dil mein zarra barabar bhalai ya imaan ho magar wo usey qabz karegi. Yahan tak ke agar tum mein se koi pahaad key pait mein dakhil ho jaey to wo us par dakhil hogi yahan tak ke usey qabz karegi. To badtareen log baqi raheingey jo parindey ki halki aur darindey key khayaal waley hongey, wo bhalai ko nahi pehchaantey hongey aur na burai ko bura samajhtey hongey. To unkey liye shaitaan aayega aur kaheyga: Kya tum qabool nahi kartey? To wo kaheingey: To tum hamein kya hukm detey ho? To wo unhey buton ki ibaadat ka hukm dega, jabke wo us mein kushada rizq waley hongey aur achchhi maeeshat waley. Phir soor phunka jaeyga. To usey koi nahi sunega magar apni gardan ka aik kinara jhukaayega aur aik kinara uthayega. Aur sab se pehley jo usey sunega wo aadmi hai jo apne oonton key hauz ko leep raha hoga. To wo behosh hoga aur log behosh hongey. Phir Allah bhejega, ya farmaya: Allah utaarega, baarish jaisey shabnam ya saaya. To us se logon key jism ugengey. Phir us mein doosri martaba phunka jaeyga aur wo khadey dekh rahey hongey. Phir kaha jaeyga: Ae logon! Apne Rab ki taraf aao, aur unhey thehrao, beshak wo poochhey jaaney waley hain. Phir kaha jaeyga: Dozakh ki kheyp nikaalo. To kaha jaeyga: Kitnon mein se? To kaha jaeyga: Har hazaar mein se nau sau ninyaanbey. To wo din bachchon ko boodha kar dega, aur wo din pindli kholney wala hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Leet gardan ka kinara hai. Aur iskey maana hain: Wo apni gardan ka kinara rakhta hai aur apna doosra kinara uthata hai."
"1811","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi sheher nahi magar Dajjaal usey raundega, siwaey Makkah aur Madina key. Aur un donon key raaston mein se koi raasta nahi magar us par farishtey safein baandhey un donon ki hifaazat kartey hain. To wo khaari zameen mein utrega. To Madina teen martaba larzega aur Allah us se har kaafir aur munaafiq ko nikaal dega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1812","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Isfahaan key Yahood mein se sattar hazaar Dajjaal ki pairwi kareingey jabke un par chaadarein hongi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1813","Umm Shareek (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Log Dajjaal se pahaadon mein bhaagengey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1814","Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Aadam ki paidaaish se qayamat qaim honay tak Dajjaal se bada muamla koi nahi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1815","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dajjaal niklega aur uski taraf mominon mein se aik aadmi mutawajjah hoga. To usey muhaafiz milengey: Dajjaal key muhaafiz. To wo us se kaheingey: Tum kahaan ka qasad kartey ho? To wo kaheyga: Main uski taraf qasad karta hun jo nikla hai. To wo us se kaheingey: Kya tum hamarey Rab par imaan nahi rakhtey? To wo kaheyga: Hamarey Rab mein koi posheedagi nahi! To wo kaheingey: Usey qatl karo. To baaz baaz se kaheingey: Kya tumharey Rab ne tumhey mana nahi kya tha ke uskey siwa kisi ko qatl na karo? To wo usey Dajjaal ki taraf ley jaengey. Phir jab momin usey dekhega to kaheyga: Ae logon! Beshak ye Dajjaal hai jiska Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zikr kya tha. To Dajjaal uskey baarey mein hukm dega aur wo usey aundha litaayega. To kaheyga: Usey pakdo aur zakhmi karo. To uski peeth aur pait maar kar kushada kar deingey. To kaheyga: Kya tum mujh par imaan nahi rakhtey? To wo kaheyga: Tum Masih Kazzab ho! To uskey baarey mein hukm diya jaeyga aur wo aarey key sath uski maang se cheera jaeyga yahan tak ke uskey donon paaon key darmiyaan judaa kar diya jaeyga. Phir Dajjaal donon tukdon key darmiyaan chalega. Phir us se kaheyga: Utho. To wo seedha khada ho jaeyga. Phir us se kaheyga: Kya tum mujh par imaan rakhtey ho? To wo kaheyga: Main ne tumharey baarey mein baseerat key siwa izafa nahi kya. Phir kaheyga: Ae logon! Beshak wo merey baad logon mein se kisi key sath nahi kar sakega. To Dajjaal usey zibah karne key liye pakdega. To Allah uski gardan se uski hansi tak taanba bana dega. To wo uski taraf koi raasta nahi pa sakega. To wo uskey donon haathon aur paaon ko pakdega aur phenk dega. To log gumaan kareingey ke usey aag ki taraf phenka hai, jabke wo Jannat mein daala gaya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye jahaanon key Rab key nazdeek sab se azeem gawahi wala hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Bukhari ne baaz hissa isi maana mein riwayat kya hai. Masaalih muhaafiz aur jasoos hain."
"1816","Mugheera bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Dajjaal key baarey mein kisi ne mujh se zyada sawal nahi kya. Aur Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhey kya nuqsaan dega? Main ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain ke uskey sath roti ka pahaad aur paani ki neher hai! Aap ne farmaya: Wo Allah par us se aasaan hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1817","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi Nabi nahi magar us ne apni ummat ko kaaney kajjaab se daraaya hai. Khabardaar! Beshak wo kaana hai, aur beshak tumhara Rab Azza wa Jall kaana nahi hai. Uski donon aankhon key darmiyaan kaaf fa ra likha hua hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1818","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey Dajjaal key baarey mein aisi hadis na bataun jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum ko nahi batai! Beshak wo kaana hai, aur beshak wo Jannat aur dozakh ki misaal key sath aayega. To wo jisey kaheyga ke wo Jannat hai wahi dozakh hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1819","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon key darmiyaan Dajjaal ka zikr kya aur farmaya: Beshak Allah kaana nahi hai. Khabardaar! Beshak Masih Dajjaal daayein aankh se kaana hai, goya uski aankh ubhra hua angoor hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1820","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Musalman Yahood se qitaal karein. Yahan tak ke Yahoodi pathar aur darakht key peechey chhupeyga. To pathar aur darakht kahega: Ae Musalman! Ye Yahoodi merey peechey hai, isliye aao aur usey qatl karo. Siwaey gharghad key, kyonke wo Yahood key darkhton mein se hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1821","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Duniya nahi jaeygi yahan tak ke aadmi qabr par guzreyga aur us par lotegaa aur kaheyga: Kaash main is qabr waley ki jagah hota. Aur usey deen nahi hoga, usey sirf aazmaaish hogi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1822","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke Furaat soney key pahaad se khul jaey jis par qitaal kya jaeyga. To har sau mein se ninyanbey qatl kiye jaengey. To un mein se har aadmi kaheyga: Shayad main hun jo nijaat paaun. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Qareeb hai ke Furaat soney key khazaaney se khul jaey. Phir jo us par haazir ho wo us mein se kuchh na ley. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1823","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Wo Madina ko chhor deingey jabke wo apni behtreen haalat par hoga. Usey sirf jangli jaanwar aabaad kareingey, yaani: Darindon aur parindon key aabaad karne waley. Aur sab se aakhir mein hashr kiye jaaney waley Muzaina key do charwaahey hongey jo Madina ka irada rakhtey hongey aur apni bakriyon ko haank-tey hongey. To wo usey darindon se bhara paengey. Yahan tak ke jab wo Saniyatul Wada tak pahunchgey to apne chehron par girengey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1824","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumharey khalifaon mein se aakhri zamaaney mein khalifa hoga jo maal bharega aur ginega nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh). Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1825","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon par zamaana aayega jis mein aadmi soney ka sadqa ley kar phirega aur us se leney wala koi nahi paayega. Aur aik aadmi dekha jaeyga jiskey peechey chaalees aurtein hongi jo us se lipti hongi mardon ki qillat aur aurton ki kasrat ki wjah se. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1826","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ne aik aadmi se zameen khareedi. To jis ne zameen khareedi thi us ne uski zameen mein ghada paaya jis mein sona tha. To jis ne zameen khareedi thi us ne us se kaha: Apna sona ley lo: Beshak main ne tum se zameen khareedi thi, aur sona nahi khareeda tha. Aur jiski zameen thi us ne kaha: Beshak main ne tumhey zameen aur jo us mein hai baicha tha. To unhon-ne aik aadmi ko faisla karne wala banaya. To jisey unhon-ne faisla karne wala banaya us ne kaha: Kya tum donon ki aulaad hai? Un mein se aik ne kaha: Mera ladka hai. Aur doosrey ne kaha: Meri ladki hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ladkey ka ladki se nikaah karo aur apne oopar us mein se kharch karo aur sadqa karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1827","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Do aurtein thein jinkey sath unkey donon betey they. Bhediya aaya aur un mein se aik key betey ko ley gaya. To us ne apni saathi se kaha: Wo tumharey betey ko ley gaya. Aur doosri ne kaha: Wo tumharey betey ko ley gaya. To unhon-ne Dawood (Alehis salaam) ko faisla karne wala banaya. To unhon-ne badey key haq mein faisla kya. To wo donon Sulaiman bin Dawood (Alehis salaam) key paas niklein aur unhey khabar di. To unhon-ne kaha: Merey paas chhuri lao taake usey un donon key darmiyaan kaatun. To chhoti ne kaha: Aisa na karo, Allah tum par rehem farmaye. Wo uska beta hai. To unhon-ne chhoti key haq mein faisla kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1828","Mirdas Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Naik log pehley pehley jaatey raheingey, aur bhoosa baqi raheyga jo jau ya khajoor key bhoosey ki tarah hoga, Allah unki parwah nahi farmayega. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1829","Rifa'a bin Raafe Zarqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jibraeel Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey: Jab Allah Taala kisi qaum par azaab naazil farmata hai. Aur Rifa'a bin Raafe Zarqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jibraeel Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur farmaya: Tum apne darmiyaan Ahle Badr ko kya shumaar kartey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Musalmanon mein sab se afzal, ya is jaisa kalima. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur is tarah wo farishtey jinhon-ne Badr mein haaziri di. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1830","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah ne farmaya: Jab Allah Taala kisi qaum par azaab naazil farmata hai to azaab unhey pahunchta hai jo un mein hain, phir wo apne aamaal par uthaey jaengey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1831","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Khajoor ka tana tha jis par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey hotey they, yaani khutbey mein. Phir jab mimbar rakha gaya to ham ne taney key liye das maah ki haamila oontni jaisi awaz suni yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utrey aur apna haath us par rakha aur wo sukoon mein aaya. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Phir jab Juma ka din hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mimbar par baithey. To khajoor ka darakht jiskey paas Aap khutba detey they cheekha yahan tak ke qareeb tha ke phat jaey. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To wo bachchey ki tarah cheekha. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utrey yahan tak ke usey pakda aur usey apne sath lagaya. To wo bachchey ki tarah roney laga jo khamosh kya jaata hai yahan tak ke theher gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo us par roya jo wo zikr se sunta tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1832","Abu Saalaba Khushani Jarsoom bin Naashir (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ne faraaiz farz kiye hain isliye unhey zaaya na karo, aur hudood muqarrar ki hain isliye un se tajawuz na karo, aur cheezein haraam ki hain isliye unki behurmati na karo, aur cheezon se khamoshi ikhtiyaar ki hai tum par rehmat key sabab baghair bhooley, isliye unkey baarey mein behes na karo. Hasan hadis hai. Ise Daaraqutni waghera ne riwayat kya hai."
"1833","Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath saat ghazwaat mein ghazwa kya jabke ham tiddi khaatey they. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ham uskey sath tiddi khaatey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1834","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin aik suraakh se do martaba nahi dasa jaata. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1835","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jin se Allah qayamat key din kalaam nahi farmayega aur na unki taraf nazar farmayega aur na unhey paak farmayega, aur unkey liye dardnaak azaab hai: Aik aadmi jiskey paas jungle mein zaaid paani ho aur wo usey musaafir se rokta hai. Aur aik aadmi jis ne kisi aadmi key sath saamaan ka sauda Asr key baad kya, phir Allah ki qasam khai ke us ne usey itni itni mein liya hai. To us ne usey sachcha samjha jabke wo uskey khilaaf tha. Aur aik aadmi jis ne imam se baiyat ki aur us se sirf duniya key liye baiyat karta hai. Phir agar wo usey us mein se dey to wafa karta hai, aur agar usey us mein se na dey to wafa nahi karta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1836","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do phunkon key darmiyaan chaalees hongey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Abu Hurairah! Kya chaalees din? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne inkaar kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya chaalees saal? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne inkaar kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya chaalees maheena? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne inkaar kya. Aur insaan ki har chiz bosida ho jaeygi siwaey uski dum ki haddi key. Us mein makhlooq jodi jaeygi. Phir Allah aasmaan se paani utaarega aur wo ugengey jaisa sabza ugta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1837","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) majlis mein qaum ko hadis bayan farma rahey they. To Aap key paas dehaati aaya aur us ne kaha: Qayamat kab hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hadis bayan farmatey rahey. To baaz logon ne kaha: Aap ne uska qaul suna aur uska qaul napasand kya. Aur baaz ne kaha: Balke nahi suna. Yahan tak ke jab Aap apni hadis se farigh huey to farmaya: Qayamat key baarey mein poochhney wala kahaan hai? Us ne kaha: Main hun ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Jab amaanat zaaya ki jaey to qayamat ka intizaar karo. Us ne kaha: Usey kaisey zaaya kya jaata hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jab muamla ghair ahel ko saunpa jaey to qayamat ka intizaar karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1838","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo tumharey liye namaz padhtey hain. Phir agar wo durust karein to tumharey liye hai, aur agar wo khata karein to tumharey liye hai aur un par hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1839","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai: Tum behtreen ummat they jo logon key liye nikaali gai. Unhon-ne kaha: Logon key liye behtreen log, wo unhey unki gardanon mein zanjeeron mein laatey hain yahan tak ke wo Islam mein dakhil hotey hain. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1840","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall taajjub farmata hai us qaum par jo Jannat mein zanjeeron mein dakhil hoti hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Iskey maana hain: Wo qaid kiye jaatey hain aur jakdey jaatey hain phir Musalman hotey hain aur Jannat mein dakhil hotey hain."
"1841","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah key nazdeek sab se mehboob sheher uski masaajid hain, aur Allah key nazdeek sab se naapasand sheher uskey bazaar hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1842","Salmaan Farsi (Raziallahu anhu) se unkey qaul se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Agar taqat rakho to bazaar mein dakhil honay walon mein sab se pehley na hona, aur na us se nikalney walon mein sab se aakhir. Kyonke wo shaitaan ki ladai ki jagah hai, aur us mein wo apna jhanda gaadta hai. Ise Muslim ne is tarah riwayat kya hai. Aur Barqaani ne apni Sahih mein Salmaan se riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bazaar mein dakhil honay walon mein sab se pehley na hona, aur na us se nikalney walon mein sab se aakhir. Us mein shaitaan ne andey diye hain aur bachchey nikaaley hain."
"1843","Aasim Ahwal se Abdullah bin Sarkhis (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah tumhey bakhsh dey. Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhey. Aasim ne kaha: To main ne un se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumharey liye maghfirat maangi? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan aur tumharey liye. Phir ye aayat padhi: Aur apne gunaah key liye, aur momin mardon aur momin aurton key liye maghfirat maango (Muhammad: 19). Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1844","Abu Masood Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak us mein se jo logon ne pehli nabuwwat key kalaam se paaya hai: Jab tum haya na karo to jo chaho karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1845","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab se pehley jiska logon key darmiyaan qayamat key din faisla kya jaeyga wo khoonon mein hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1846","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishtey noor se paida kiye gaey hain, aur jinn aag key sholey se paida kiye gaey hain, aur Aadam us se paida kiye gaey hain jo tumharey liye bayan kya gaya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1847","Unhin se (Raziallahu anha) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka akhlaaq Quran tha. Ise Muslim ne taweel hadis key jumley mein riwayat kya hai."
"1848","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah se milney ko pasand karey to Allah us se milney ko pasand farmata hai, aur jo Allah se milney ko napasand karey to Allah us se milney ko napasand farmata hai. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya maut ki napasandgi hai? Ham sab maut ko napasand kartey hain! Aap ne farmaya: Aisa nahi hai, lekin momin ko jab Allah ki rehmat aur uski raza aur uski Jannat ki bashaarat di jaati hai to wo Allah se milney ko pasand karta hai, to Allah us se milney ko pasand farmata hai. Aur beshak kaafir ko jab Allah key azaab aur uski naraazgi ki khabar di jaati hai to wo Allah se milney ko napasand karta hai aur Allah us se milney ko napasand farmata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1849","Ummul Momineen Safiya bint Huyayy (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) etikaf mein they. To main Aap ki ziyaarat key liye raat mein Aap key paas aai. To Aap se baat ki phir khadi hui taake wapas jaun. To Aap merey sath khadey huey taake mujhey wapas karein. To Ansaar mein se do aadmi (Raziallahu anhuma) guzrey. Phir jab unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha to tez chaley. To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni raftar par raho, beshak ye Safiya bint Huyayy hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Subhan Allah ya Rasulullah! Beshak shaitaan aadmi key betey mein khoon ki tarah daudta hai, aur beshak mujhey khauf hua ke wo tumharey dilon mein shar daal dey, ya farmaya: Koi chiz. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1850","Abul Fazl Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hunain key din haazir tha. To main aur Abu Sufyan bin Al-Haaris bin Abdul Muttalib Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath lagey rahey aur Aap se judaa na huey, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne safed khachchar par they. Phir jab Musalman aur mushrik miley to Musalman peeth pher kar bhaag gaey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne khachchar ko kaafiron ki taraf daudaaney lagey, jabke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key khachchar ki lagaam pakdey huey tha, usey rokta tha ke tez na chaley, aur Abu Sufyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki rakaab pakdey huey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abbas! Babul key saathiyon ko pukaaro. Abbas ne kaha, jo buland awaz waley aadmi they, to main ne apni buland awaz se kaha: Babul waley saathi kahaan hain? Allah ki qasam! Goya unka jhukna jab unhon-ne meri awaz suni gaayon ka apne bachchon par jhukna tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae labbaik ae labbaik. To wo aur kaafir qitaal karney lagey, aur Ansaar mein pukaar thi jo kehtey they: Ae Ansaar ki jamaat! Ae Ansaar ki jamaat! Phir pukaar Bani Al-Haaris bin Al-Khazraj par khatm hui. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha jabke Aap apne khachchar par unkey qitaal ki taraf jhuktey huey they. To farmaya: Ye hai jab ladai garam hui. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kankariyan lein aur unhey kaafiron key chehron par phenka. Phir farmaya: Muhammad key Rab ki qasam shikast kha gaey. To main dekhney gaya aur qitaal apni haalat par tha jo main dekhta hun. Allah ki qasam! Wo sirf ye tha ke Aap ne unhey apni kankariyan maarein. To main unki quwwat ko kamzori aur unkey muamley ko peeth pherna dekhta raha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Watees tandoor hai, aur iskey maana hain: Ladai shadeed hui. Aur uska qaul had dahum ha muhmala key sath hai, yaani unki quwwat."
"1851","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak Allah paak hai aur paak key siwa qabool nahi farmata. Aur beshak Allah ne mominon ko uska hukm diya hai jiska us ne Rasoolon ko hukm diya tha. To Taala ne farmaya: Ae Rasoolon! Paak cheezon mein se khao aur naik amal karo. Aur Taala ne farmaya: Ae imaan walon! Jo paak cheezein ham ne tumhey rizq di hain us mein se khao. Phir us aadmi ka zikr kya jo lamba safar karta hai jabke wo bikra hua ghubaar aalood hai aur apne donon haathon ko aasmaan ki taraf pheelata hai: Ae Rab! Ae Rab! Jabke uska khaana haraam hai, aur uska peena haraam hai, aur uska libaas haraam hai, aur usey haraam se ghiza di gai hai. To uskey liye kaisey qabool kya jaeyga!? Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1852","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jin se Allah qayamat key din kalaam nahi farmayega, aur na unhey paak farmayega, aur na unki taraf nazar farmayega, aur unkey liye dardnaak azaab hai: Boodha zina karne wala, aur jhoota baadshah, aur maghroor faqeer. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1853","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saihaan aur Jaihaan aur Furaat aur Neel sab Jannat ki nehron mein se hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1854","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera haath pakda aur farmaya: Allah ne matti ko hafta key din paida kya, aur us mein pahaad Etwaar key din paida kiye, aur darakht Peer key din paida kiye, aur napasand Mangal key din paida kiye, aur noor Budh key din paida kiye, aur us mein jaanwar Jumeraat key din pheelaey, aur Aadam (Alehis salaam) ko Jumey key din Asr key baad paida kya aakhri makhlooq mein din ki aakhri ghadi mein Asr se raat key darmiyaan. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1855","Abu Sulaiman Khaalid bin Al-Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Mota key din merey haath mein nau talwaarein toot gaein, aur merey haath mein Yamani dastaney key siwa kuchh na bacha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1856","Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab haakim faisla karey aur ijtihaad karey, phir durust ho to uskey liye do ajr hain. Aur agar faisla karey aur ijtihaad karey aur khata karey to uskey liye aik ajr hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1857","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bukhaar dozakh ki bhaap hai, isliye usey paani se thanda karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1858","Unhin se (Raziallahu anha) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mar jaey jabke us par roza ho to uska wali uski taraf se roza rakhey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1859","Auf bin Maalik bin At-Tufail se riwayat hai ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne hadis bayan ki ke Abdullah bin Az-Zubair (Raziallahu anhuma) ne us bai ya atiya key baarey mein kaha jo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne usey di thi: Allah ki qasam! Aaisha zaroor baaz aayegi, ya main us par pabandi lagaunga. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya us ne ye kaha hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah key liye mujh par nazr hai ke main Ibn Az-Zubair se kabhi kalaam nahi karungi. To Ibn Az-Zubair ne us se sifarish karwai jab judai lambi hui. To unhon-ne kaha: Nahi Allah ki qasam! Main uskey baarey mein kabhi sifarish nahi karungi, aur na apni nazr ko todungi. Phir jab wo Ibn Az-Zubair par lamba hua to us ne Miswar Ibn Makhrama aur Abdur Rahman bin Al-Aswad bin Abd Yaghoos se baat ki aur un donon se kaha: Main tumhey Allah ki qasam deta hun ke tum donon mujhey Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) key paas dakhil karo, kyonke uskey liye halaal nahi ke wo meri qata talluq ki nazr maaney. To Miswar aur Abdur Rahman usey ley kar aey yahan tak ke unhon-ne Aaisha se ijazat maangi. To unhon-ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rehmatullahi wa barakatuhu, kya ham dakhil hon? Aaisha ne kaha: Dakhil ho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham sab? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan tum sab dakhil ho, jabke wo nahi jaanti thein ke un donon key sath Ibn Az-Zubair hain. Phir jab wo dakhil huey to Ibn Az-Zubair pardey mein dakhil hua aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se lipat gaya. Aur usey qasam deney laga aur ronay laga, aur Miswar aur Abdur Rahman usey qasam deney lagey ke wo us se kalaam karey aur us se qabool karey. Aur wo kehtey: Beshak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya hai jo tum jaanti ho qata talluq ka, aur Musalman key liye halaal nahi ke wo apne bhai se teen raaton se zyada qata talluq karey. Phir jab unhon-ne Aaisha par yaad dihaani aur sakhti ki kasrat ki to wo unhey yaad karne lagein aur ronay lagein. Aur kehti hain: Beshak main ne nazr maani hai aur nazr sakht hai. To wo donon us par rahey yahan tak ke us ne Ibn Az-Zubair se kalaam kya, aur us ne apni us nazr mein chaalees gardaney aazaad kein. Aur wo uskey baad apni nazr ko yaad karti to roti yahan tak ke uskey aansu uskey dupattey ko bhigo detey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1860","Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Uhad key shaheedon ki taraf nikley aur aath saal baad un par namaz padhi goya zindon aur murdon ko rukhsat karne waley hon. Phir mimbar par chadhey aur farmaya: Beshak main tumharey aagey aagey hun aur main tum par gawaah hun. Aur beshak tumhara waada Hauz hai, aur beshak main usey apne is maqaam se dekhta hun. Aur beshak mujhey tum par shirk ka khauf nahi hai, lekin mujhey tum par duniya ka khauf hai ke tum us par muqaabla karogey. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo aakhri nazar thi jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Lekin mujhey tum par duniya ka khauf hai ke tum us mein muqaabla karogey, aur qitaal karogey aur halaak ho jaogey jaisa tum se pehley halaak huey. Uqba ne kaha: To wo aakhri tha jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par dekha. Aur aik riwayat mein farmaya: Beshak main tumharey liye aagey hun aur main tum par gawaah hun, aur beshak Allah ki qasam main ab apne hauz ko dekhta hun. Aur beshak mujhey zameen key khazaanon ki chaabiyan di gai hain, ya zameen ki chaabiyan. Aur beshak Allah ki qasam mujhey tum par khauf nahi ke tum merey baad shirk karogey, lekin mujhey tum par khauf hai ke tum us mein muqaabla karogey. Aur Uhad key shaheedon par namaz se muraad unkey liye dua hai, maroof namaz nahi."
"1861","Abu Zaid Amr bin Akhtab Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Fajr padhai aur mimbar par chadhey. To ham se khutba farmaya yahan tak ke Zuhr haazir hui. To utrey aur namaz padhi. Phir mimbar par chadhey yahan tak ke Asr haazir hui. Phir utrey aur namaz padhi. Phir mimbar par chadhey yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho gaya. To hamein khabar di jo tha aur jo honay wala hai. To ham mein sab se zyada jaanne wala sab se zyada yaad rakhne wala hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1862","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo nazr maaney ke Allah ki itaat karey to usey itaat karni chahiye, aur jo nazr maaney ke Allah ki nafarmaani karey to usey nafarmaani nahi karni chahiye. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1863","Umm Shareek (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey chhipkaliyan qatl karne ka hukm diya aur farmaya: Wo Ibrahim par phoonkti thein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1864","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo pehli maar mein chhipkali qatl karey to uskey liye itni itni neki hai. Aur jo usey doosri maar mein qatl karey to uskey liye itni itni neki hai, aur pehley se kam. Aur agar usey teesri maar mein qatl karey to uskey liye itni itni neki hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jo pehli maar mein chhipkali qatl karey to uskey liye sau neki likhi jaati hai, aur doosri mein us se kam, aur teesri mein us se kam. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Ahl-e-lughat ne kaha: Wazagh saam abras mein se badi hai."
"1865","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ne kaha: Main zaroor sadqa karunga. To wo apne sadqey key sath nikla aur usey chor key haath mein rakh diya. To wo subah baat karne lagey: Chor par sadqa kya gaya! To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Terey liye hamd hai, main zaroor sadqa karunga. To wo apne sadqey key sath nikla aur usey zaaniya key haath mein rakh diya?! To wo subah baat karne lagey: Zaaniya par sadqa kya gaya! To us ne kaha: Ae Allah! Za aniya par Terey liye hamd hai, main zaroor sadqa karunga. To wo apne sadqey key sath nikla aur usey maaldaar key haath mein rakh diya. To wo subah baat karne lagey! Aaj raat maaldaar par sadqa kya gaya. To us se kaha gaya: Ae Allah! Chor par, aur zaaniya par, aur maaldaar par Terey liye hamd hai! To uskey paas aaya aur us se kaha gaya: Raha tumhara chor par sadqa to shayed wo apni chori se paak ho jaey. Aur rahi zaaniya to shayed wo apne zina se paak ho jaey. Aur raha maaldaar to shayed wo ibrat haasil karey aur us mein se kharch karey jo Allah ne usey diya hai. Ise Bukhari ne apne lafz key sath riwayat kya hai, aur Muslim ne maana key sath."
"1866","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath dawat mein they. To Aap ki taraf dastaana pesh kya gaya, aur wo Aap ko pasand tha. To Aap ne us mein se nawala liya aur farmaya: Main qayamat key din logon ka sardar hun. Kya tum jaantey ho wo kis se hai? Allah awwaleen aur aakhireen ko aik maidaan mein jama farmayega. To dekhney wala unhey dekhega, aur pukaarne wala unhey sunaayega, aur suraj un se qareeb hoga. To logon ko ghum aur takleef pahunchy gi jo wo bardasht nahi kar sakengey aur na utha sakengey. To log kaheingey: Kya tum nahi dekhtey ke tum kis mein ho aur tumhey kya pahuncha hai? Kya tum nahi dekhtey ke tumharey Rab ki taraf tumharey liye kaun sifarish karey? To baaz log baaz se kaheingey: Tumharey waalid Aadam. Aur wo unkey paas aaengey aur kaheingey: Ae Aadam! Tum bashar key waalid ho. Allah ne tumhey apne haath se paida kya, aur tum mein apni rooh phun ki, aur farishton ko hukm diya aur unhon-ne tumhey sajda kya, aur tumhey Jannat mein thikaana diya. Kya tum hamarey liye hamarey Rab se sifarish nahi kartey? Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain aur hamein kya pahuncha hai? To wo kaheingey: Beshak merey Rab ne ghazab farmaya hai aisa ghazab jo us se pehley waisa nahi farmaya, aur na uskey baad waisa farmayega. Aur beshak us ne mujhey darakht se mana farmaya tha aur main ne nafarmaani ki. Meri jaan meri jaan meri jaan. Merey siwa kisi key paas jao. Nooh key paas jao. To wo Nooh key paas aaengey aur kaheingey: Ae Nooh! Tum zameen walon ki taraf pehley Rasool ho, aur Allah ne tumhey shukr guzaar banda kaha hai. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? Kya tum nahi dekhtey hamein kya pahuncha hai? Kya tum hamarey liye hamarey Rab se sifarish nahi kartey? To wo kaheingey: Beshak merey Rab ne aaj ghazab farmaya hai aisa ghazab jo us se pehley waisa nahi farmaya, aur uskey baad waisa nahi farmayega. Aur beshak meri aik dua thi jo main ne apni qaum par ki thi. Meri jaan meri jaan meri jaan. Merey siwa kisi key paas jao. Ibrahim key paas jao. To wo Ibrahim key paas aaengey aur kaheingey: Ae Ibrahim! Tum Allah key Nabi aur zameen walon mein se uskey khaleel ho. Hamarey liye hamarey Rab se sifarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To wo un se kaheingey: Beshak merey Rab ne aaj ghazab farmaya hai aisa ghazab jo us se pehley waisa nahi farmaya, aur uskey baad waisa nahi farmayega. Aur beshak main ne teen jhoot kaha tha. Meri jaan meri jaan meri jaan. Merey siwa kisi key paas jao. Musa key paas jao. To wo Musa key paas aaengey aur kaheingey: Ae Musa! Tum Allah key Rasool ho, Allah ne tumhey apne paighaamon aur apne kalaam key sath logon par fazilat di hai. Hamarey liye hamarey Rab se sifarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To wo kaheingey: Beshak merey Rab ne aaj ghazab farmaya hai aisa ghazab jo us se pehley waisa nahi farmaya, aur uskey baad waisa nahi farmayega. Aur beshak main ne aik jaan qatl ki thi jiskey qatl ka mujhey hukm nahi diya gaya tha. Meri jaan meri jaan meri jaan. Merey siwa kisi key paas jao. Eesa key paas jao. To wo Eesa key paas aaengey aur kaheingey: Ae Eesa! Tum Allah key Rasool aur uska kalima ho jo us ne Maryam ki taraf daala aur uski taraf se rooh ho. Aur tum ne jhooley mein logon se kalaam kya. Hamarey liye hamarey Rab se sifarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To Eesa kaheingey: Beshak merey Rab ne aaj ghazab farmaya hai aisa ghazab jo us se pehley waisa nahi farmaya, aur uskey baad waisa nahi farmayega. Aur unhon-ne koi gunaah zikr nahi kya. Meri jaan meri jaan meri jaan. Merey siwa kisi key paas jao. Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas jao. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To wo merey paas aaengey aur kaheingey: Ae Muhammad! Tum Allah key Rasool aur Nabiyon key khaatim ho, aur tumharey liye tumhara agla aur peechla gunaah bakhsh diya gaya hai. Hamarey liye hamarey Rab se sifarish karo. Kya tum nahi dekhtey ham kis mein hain? To main chalunga aur Arsh key neechey aaunga aur apne Rab ko sajda karunga. Phir Allah mujh par apni hamd aur apni sana mein se khol dega jo mujh se pehley kisi par nahi khola. Phir kaha jaeyga: Ae Muhammad! Apna sar uthayo, maango diya jaeyga, aur sifarish karo qabool ki jaeygi. To main apna sar uthaaunga aur kahunga: Meri ummat ae Rab! Meri ummat ae Rab! To kaha jaeyga: Ae Muhammad! Apni ummat mein se usey dakhil karo jis par hisaab nahi hai Jannat key darwaazon mein se daayein darwaazey se, jabke wo logon key shareek hain uskey siwa darwaazon mein. Phir farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak Jannat key darwaazon mein se do kiwaron key darmiyaan Makkah aur Hajar key darmiyaan jaisa faasla hai, ya Makkah aur Busra key darmiyaan jaisa. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1867","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ibrahim (Alehis salaam) Ismaeel ki walida aur unkey betey Ismaeel ko laey jabke wo usey doodh pila rahi thein, yahan tak ke unhey Baitullah key paas darakht key neechey Zamzam key oopar masjid key aala hissey mein rakha, jabke us din Makkah mein koi na tha aur na wahaan paani tha. To unhey wahaan rakha aur unkey paas khajoor ka thaila rakha jis mein khajoor thein, aur mashqeeza rakha jis mein paani tha. Phir Ibrahim peeth pher kar chaley. To Ismaeel ki walida unkey peechey chalein aur kaha: Ae Ibrahim! Tum kahaan jaatey ho aur hamein is waadi mein chhortey ho jis mein koi maanoos nahi aur na kuchh hai? To unhon-ne un se baar baar kaha, jabke wo unki taraf mutawajjah nahi hotey they. Unhon-ne un se kaha: Kya Allah ne tumhey iska hukm diya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Tab wo hamein zaaya nahi farmayega. Phir wapas aaein. To Ibrahim (Alehis salaam) chaley yahan tak ke jab wo ghaati mein they jahaan wo unhey dekhtey hain, apne chehrey key sath Baitullah ki taraf mutawajjah huey. Phir in duaon key sath dua ki aur apne donon haath uthayein aur farmaya: Ae hamarey Rab! Beshak main ne apni aulaad mein se is waadi mein thikaana diya jo kheti wali nahi, yahan tak ke pahunchy: Shukr karein. Aur Ismaeel ki walida Ismaeel ko doodh pilaati rahein aur us paani mein se peeti rahein. Yahan tak ke jab mashqeezey mein jo tha khatm ho gaya to pyaasi huein aur unka beta pyaasa hua. Aur wo uski taraf dekhney lagein ke wo tadap raha hai, ya farmaya: Zameen par lot raha hai. To us se niklein ke usey dekhna napasand karti thein. To unhon-ne Safa ko paaya jo zameen mein un se qareeb tareen pahaad tha. To us par khadi huein. Phir waadi ki taraf mutawajjah huein aur dekhney lagein ke kya wo kisi ko dekhti hain? To kisi ko na dekha. To Safa se utrein yahan tak ke jab waadi tak pahunchin to apni qameez ka kinara uthaya. Phir thakey huey insaan ki daud daudin yahan tak ke waadi se guzar gaein. Phir Marwa par aaein. To us par khadi huein aur dekhney lagein ke kya wo kisi ko dekhti hain? To kisi ko na dekha. To saat martaba aisa kya. Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To logon ki daud un donon key darmiyaan isi se hai. Phir jab Marwa par chadhein to awaz suni. To kaha: Khamosh, apne aap ko chahti thein. Phir kaan lagaya aur phir suni. To kaha: Tum ne suna diya hai, agar tumharey paas faryaad hai to faryaad karo. To achanak farishta Zamzam ki jagah par tha. To us ne apni aidi, ya farmaya apne par se khoda yahan tak ke paani zaahir hua. To wo usey hauz banaaney lagein aur apne haath se is tarah kehti thein. Aur mashqeezey mein paani bharney lagein jabke wo ubal raha tha uskey bharney key baad. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jitna wo bharti thein. Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ismaeel ki walida par rehem farmaye, agar wo Zamzam ko chhor detin, ya farmaya: Agar wo paani mein se na bharti to Zamzam behta hua chashma hota. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhon-ne piya aur apne betey ko doodh pilaaya. To farishtey ne un se kaha: Zaaya honay ka khauf na karo, kyonke yahaan Allah ka ghar hai jisey ye ladka aur uskey waalid banayengey. Aur beshak Allah uskey ghar walon ko zaaya nahi farmata. Aur ghar zameen se teelay ki tarah buland tha, us par sailaab aatey they aur uskey daayein aur baayein se letey they. To wo is tarah thein yahan tak ke unkey paas Jurhum ka qafila guzra, ya Jurhum ka ghar jo Kada key raastey se aatey huey they. To wo Makkah key neechey utrey. To unhon-ne parinda dekha jo chakkar lagaa raha tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak ye parinda paani par chakkar lagaa raha hai, jabke hamara is waadi key sath ahd hai aur us mein paani nahi hai. To unhon-ne aik ya do daudney waley bhejey. To wo paani par paey gaey. To wo wapas aey aur unhey khabar di. To wo aey jabke Ismaeel ki walida paani key paas thein. To unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum hamein ijazat deti ho ke ham tumharey paas utrein? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, lekin paani mein tumhara koi haq nahi hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To Ismaeel ki walida ne usey paaya, jabke wo maanoos pasand karti thein. To wo utrey aur apne ghar walon ko bheja aur wo unkey sath utrey. Yahan tak ke jab un mein gharon waley ho gaey aur ladka bada hua aur un se Arbi seekhi aur unhey pasand kya aur jab bada hua to unhon-ne uski shaadi un mein se aik aurat se ki. Aur Ismaeel ki walida faut ho gaein. To Ibrahim Ismaeel key shaadi key baad uski viraasat dekhney aey aur Ismaeel ko na paaya. To uski biwi se uskey baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Wo hamarey liye kamaaney gaya hai, aur aik riwayat mein hai: Hamarey liye shikaar karne. Phir us se unki maeeshat aur haalat key baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Ham burey hain, ham tangi aur sakhti mein hain. Aur us se shikayat ki. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab tumhara shohar aey to usey salaam kehna aur kehna: Apne darwaazey ki chaukhat badal do. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo merey waalid hain aur unhon-ne mujhey hukm diya hai ke tumhey judaa karun. Apne ghar walon se mil jao. To usey talaaq di aur un mein se doosri se shaadi ki. To Ibrahim un se jitna Allah ne chaaha door rahey phir uskey baad unkey paas aey aur usey na paaya. To uski biwi key paas dakhil huey aur us se uskey baarey mein poochha. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo hamarey liye kamaaney gaya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum kaisey ho? Aur us se unki maeeshat aur haalat key baarey mein poochha. To us ne kaha: Ham bhalai aur kushadgi mein hain, aur Allah Taala ki sana ki. To farmaya: Tumhara khaana kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Gosht. Unhon-ne kaha: To tumhara peena kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Paani. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Unhey gosht aur paani mein barkat ata farma. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur us din unkey paas daana nahi tha, aur agar unkey paas hota to unkey liye us mein dua farmatey. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo donon Makkah key siwa kisi par khaali nahi hotey magar unkey muwaafiq nahi hotey. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To aey aur kaha: Ismaeel kahaan hai? To uski biwi ne kaha: Wo shikaar karne gaya hai. To uski biwi ne kaha: Kya tum nahi utrogey aur khaogey aur piyogey? Unhon-ne kaha: Aur tumhara khaana aur peena kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Hamara khaana gosht hai, aur hamara peena paani hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah! Unhey unkey khaaney aur peeney mein barkat ata farma. Unhon-ne kaha: To Abul Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibrahim (Alehis salaam) ki dua ki barkat. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab tumhara shohar aey to usey salaam kehna aur usey hukm dena ke apne darwaazey ki chaukhat saabit rakhey. Phir jab Ismaeel aey to kaha: Kya tumharey paas koi aaya tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, hamarey paas achchhi shakal ka boodha aaya tha, aur uski tareef ki. To us ne mujh se tumharey baarey mein poochha aur main ne usey khabar di. To us ne mujh se hamari maeeshat key baarey mein poochha aur main ne usey khabar di ke ham bhalai mein hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne tumhey kisi baat ki waseeyat ki? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan, wo tumhey salaam kehta hai aur tumhey hukm deta hai ke apne darwaazey ki chaukhat saabit rakho. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo merey waalid hain aur tum chaukhat ho, unhon-ne mujhey hukm diya hai ke tumhey rokun. Phir un se jitna Allah ne chaaha door rahey. Phir uskey baad aey jabke Ismaeel Zamzam key qareeb darakht key neechey apne teer taraash rahey they. Phir jab us ne unhey dekha to unki taraf khada hua. To us ne waisa kya jaisa waalid bachchey key sath karta hai, aur bachcha waalid key sath. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae Ismaeel! Beshak Allah ne mujhey aik kaam ka hukm diya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo karo jo tumhara Rab tumhey dikhaata hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Aur tum meri madad karogey? Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main tumhari madad karunga. Unhon-ne kaha: To beshak Allah ne mujhey hukm diya hai ke yahaan ghar banaaun, aur ird gird se buland teelay ki taraf ishara kya. To us waqt ghar ki bunyaadein uthaein. To Ismaeel pathar laatey they aur Ibrahim banaatey they, yahan tak ke jab imaarat buland hui to ye pathar laey aur uskey liye rakha aur us par khadey huey, jabke wo bana rahey they aur Ismaeel unhey pathar de rahey they, jabke wo donon kehtey they: Ae hamarey Rab! Ham se qabool farma, beshak Tu hi sunney wala jaanne wala hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Beshak Ibrahim Ismaeel aur Ismaeel ki walida ko ley kar nikley, unkey sath mashqeeza tha jis mein paani tha. To Ismaeel ki walida mashqeezey mein se peeti rahein aur unka doodh unkey bachchey par utarta raha yahan tak ke Makkah aaein. To unhey darakht key neechey rakha. Phir Ibrahim apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas aey. To Ismaeel ki walida unkey peechey chalein yahan tak ke jab wo Kada tak pahunchy to unhon-ne unhey peechey se pukaara: Ae Ibrahim! Tum hamein kiskey supurd kartey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah key. Unhon-ne kaha: Main Allah par raazi hun. To wapas aaein. Aur mashqeezey mein se peeti rahein aur unka doodh unkey bachchey par utarta raha yahan tak ke jab paani khatm ho gaya to unhon-ne kaha: Kaash main jaati aur dekhti ke shayed main kisi ko mehsoos karun. Unhon-ne kaha: To gaein aur Safa par chadhein aur dekha aur dekha ke kya wo kisi ko mehsoos karti hain. Phir jab waadi tak pahunchin to suni aur Marwa par aaein. Aur saat chakkar aisa kya. Phir kaha: Kaash main jaati aur dekhti ke bachchey ne kya kya. To gaein aur dekha aur wo apni haalat par tha goya wo maut key liye hichki ley raha tha. To unka dil na maana. To kaha: Kaash main jaati aur dekhti ke shayed main kisi ko mehsoos karun. To gaein aur Safa par chadhein aur dekha aur dekha, lekin kisi ko mehsoos na kya yahan tak ke saat poorey kiye. Phir kaha: Kaash main jaati aur dekhti ke us ne kya kya. To wo awaz key saath thein. To unhon-ne kaha: Faryaad karo agar tumharey paas bhalai hai. To achanak Jibraeel (Alehis salaam) they. To unhon-ne apni aidi se is tarah kaha aur zameen par apni aidi se ishara kya aur paani phoot pada. To Ismaeel ki walida hairan huein aur bharney lagein. Aur taweel hadis zikr ki. Ise Bukhari ne in tamaam riwayaat key sath riwayat kya hai. Dauhah bada darakht hai. Uska qaul qaffa yaani peeth pheri. Waljari qaasid hai. Walfa yaani paaya. Uska qaul yan shighu yaani hichki leta hai."
"1868","Saeed bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Khumbi mann mein se hai, aur uska paani aankh key liye shifa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
